    "translations": {
      "en": {
        "description": "Rain Bird HE-VAN-12 is an adjustable spray nozzle for precise watering of lawns, borders and flower beds. The nozzle produces a fan-shaped spray and allows the installer to set the watering arc to suit the shape of the area. The stated radius is 2.7–3.7 m, the available arc is 0–360°, and the recommended operating pressure is 1.0–2.1 bar.\n\nThe VAN range is suitable for smaller zones and close-range watering. HE-VAN models are designed for improved application efficiency when used at the correct pressure and with a suitable layout. The radius can be fine-tuned using the adjustment screw. Always select a nozzle that matches the sprinkler body, required coverage and flow available to the zone.\n\nCompatible with suitable Rain Bird 1800/RD1800 series spray bodies. Actual radius can vary with pressure, nozzle setting and site conditions.",
        "formattedDescription": [
          {
            "_key": "HE1201-en-b0",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "HE1201-en-s1",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Rain Bird HE-VAN-12 — high-efficiency adjustable spray nozzle"
