            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "HE1201-en-b5",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "HE1201-en-s6",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Rain Bird HE-VAN nozzles deliver an average DULQ of 70%, more than a 40% improvement over typical variable-arc spray nozzles."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "HE1201-en-b6",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "HE1201-en-s7",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Operating pressure and adjustment"
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "h2"
          },
          {
            "_key": "HE1201-en-b7",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "HE1201-en-s8",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Set the arc using the centre collar, which provides a tactile click to help keep the setting in place. The stainless-steel screw adjusts flow and radius; reducing the radius by more than 25% is not recommended."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "HE1201-en-b8",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "HE1201-en-s9",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [
                  "strong"
                ],
                "text": "Operating pressure: 1.0–2.1 bar; optimum pressure: 2.1 bar. Check dynamic pressure directly at the nozzle."
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "_key": "HE1201-en-b9",
            "_type": "block",
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "HE1201-en-s10",
                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "Compatibility and installation"
              }
            ],
            "markDefs": [],
            "style": "h2"
          },
          {
