                "_type": "span",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "We deliver throughout Bulgaria with Econt, either to a courier office or to your address. Engineer delivery to the site may be arranged in Nessebar and the Burgas area. Installation, adjustment and repair are available for an additional fee. See the "
              },
